<title>JAPAN: Foreigners net buyer of Japan stocks via 11 firms.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net buyer of Japan stocks via 11 firms.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Orders placed by foreign investors through 11 foreign securities houses before the start of stock trading on Wednesday showed a net buying stance of 8.6 million shares, market sources said.</p>
<p>Foreign investor sell orders totalled 19.7 million shares while buy orders amounted to 28.3 million shares.</p>
